# Downloaded price data. Reproducible from Yahoo and rewritten by the 12h
# staleness check on every run, so tracking it would churn on each execution.
# The audit trail that matters is in results/*.log: every run prints an
# integrity report giving each series' date range, bar count, annualised vol
# and extreme returns, so a future download can be checked against what the
# published figures were actually computed from.
data_cache/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.tmp
results/*.tmp
